<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Wednesday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Carcass basis steers and heifers were not well tested. Steers - Select to mostly Chocie 2-4 1250 lbs ld  120.00. Reported sales for Wed -  100.  Week to Date- 29,300</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
